A file target that does not exist is not created — the hook exits 2 and relays the writer's own
failure.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-hooks
title: Hooks
summary: Hook-bearing fixture for playbook-transition.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  only: []

states:
  main:
    artifact: index.md
    initial: intaking
    statuses:
      intaking:
        transitions:
          - to: noted
            when: never — the target does not exist
            hooks: ["frontmatter-update nope.md reviewed=recorded"]
      noted: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/only/prompt.md --
---
summary: Only step.
---

Only body.
-- fixtures/cwd/run/.keep --
-- cmd --
booping playbook-transition fx-hooks intaking --workdir run
booping playbook-transition fx-hooks noted --workdir run
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
created index.md
not-started → intaking
frontmatter: status=intaking
-- stderr --
error: frontmatter-update failed: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '{CWD}/run/nope.md'
